```sql
-- 2) Description:  Look at the earliest and latest purchase dates
--    among the “delivered” orders – this will help when we calculate Recency.
SELECT MIN("order_purchase_timestamp") AS "earliest_delivered",
       MAX("order_purchase_timestamp") AS "latest_delivered"
FROM "orders"
WHERE "order_status" = 'delivered';
```

```sql
-- 3) Description:  Preview how customer_id maps to customer_unique_id
